AltoLeverageSwapperForWrapperToken::swap
├── when caller is not whitelisted
│   └── it should revert with AltoLeverageSwapperSenderNotValid
└── given caller is whitelisted
    ├── when neither sellToken nor buyToken is MARKET collateral token
    │   └── it should revert with AltoLeverageSwapperInvalidInput
    ├── when swapTarget is not valid
    │   └── it should revert with AltoLeverageSwapperInvalidSwapTarget
    ├── when underlyingToken does not match collateral wrapper underlyingToken
    │   └── it should revert with AltoLeverageSwapperInvalidInput
    ├── when sellToken transferFrom fails
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── given sellToken is MARKET collateral token
    │   ├── when unwrap reverts
    │   │   └── it should revert
    │   ├── when swap call fails
    │   │   └── it should revert with AltoLeverageSwapperSwapFailed
    │   ├── when buy token received is less than minAmountOut
    │   │   └── it should revert with AltoLeverageSwapperMinAmountOutNotMet
    │   ├── given collateral token was donated to swapper
    │   │   └── when swap underlying amount matches swapData but swapper holds extra donated collateral
    │   │       ├── it should pull collateral token from caller
    │   │       ├── it should unwrap collateral to underlying PT
    │   │       ├── it should approve swapTarget for PT amount
    │   │       ├── it should execute swap via swapTarget
    │   │       ├── it should reset swapTarget approval to zero
    │   │       ├── it should transfer buy tokens to caller
    │   │       ├── it should emit Swap
    │   │       ├── it should return buyTokenBalanceReceived
    │   │       └── it should leave donated collateral token on swapper
    │   ├── given underlying token was donated to swapper
    │   │   └── when swap underlying amount matches swapData but swapper holds extra donated underlying
    │   │       ├── it should pull collateral token from caller
    │   │       ├── it should unwrap collateral to underlying PT
    │   │       ├── it should approve swapTarget for PT amount
    │   │       ├── it should execute swap via swapTarget
    │   │       ├── it should reset swapTarget approval to zero
    │   │       ├── it should transfer buy tokens to caller
    │   │       ├── it should emit Swap
    │   │       ├── it should return buyTokenBalanceReceived
    │   │       └── it should leave donated underlying token on swapper
    │   └── when swap succeeds
    │       ├── it should pull collateral token from caller
    │       ├── it should unwrap collateral to underlying PT
    │       ├── it should approve swapTarget for PT amount
    │       ├── it should execute swap via swapTarget
    │       ├── it should reset swapTarget approval to zero
    │       ├── when swap leaves sell token balance
    │       │   └── it should transfer leftover sell tokens to caller
    │       ├── it should transfer buy tokens to caller
    │       ├── it should leave zero sellToken balance on contract
    │       ├── it should leave zero buyToken balance on contract
    │       ├── it should leave zero collateral token balance on contract
    │       ├── it should leave zero underlyingToken balance on contract
    │       ├── it should emit Swap
    │       └── it should return buyTokenBalanceReceived
    └── given buyToken is MARKET collateral token
        ├── when swap call fails
        │   └── it should revert with AltoLeverageSwapperSwapFailed
        ├── when buy token received is less than minAmountOut
        │   └── it should revert with AltoLeverageSwapperMinAmountOutNotMet
        ├── given collateral token was donated to swapper
        │   └── when swap sell amount matches swapData but swapper holds extra donated collateral
        │       ├── it should pull sellToken from caller
        │       ├── it should swap sellToken for underlying PT
        │       ├── it should approve collateral wrapper for received PT
        │       ├── it should wrap underlying PT to collateral token
        │       ├── it should reset underlying PT approval to zero
        │       ├── it should transfer wrapped collateral tokens to caller
        │       ├── it should emit Swap with underlying PT amount as buyTokenBalanceReceived
        │       ├── it should return wrapped collateral amount received
        │       └── it should leave donated collateral token on swapper
        ├── given underlying token was donated to swapper
        │   └── when swap sell amount matches swapData but swapper holds extra donated underlying
        │       ├── it should pull sellToken from caller
        │       ├── it should swap sellToken for underlying PT
        │       ├── it should approve collateral wrapper for received PT
        │       ├── it should wrap underlying PT to collateral token
        │       ├── it should reset underlying PT approval to zero
        │       ├── it should transfer wrapped collateral tokens to caller
        │       ├── it should emit Swap with underlying PT amount as buyTokenBalanceReceived
        │       ├── it should return wrapped collateral amount received
        │       └── it should leave donated underlying token on swapper
        └── when swap succeeds
            ├── it should pull sellToken from caller
            ├── it should swap sellToken for underlying PT
            ├── it should approve collateral wrapper for received PT
            ├── it should wrap underlying PT to collateral token
            ├── it should reset underlying PT approval to zero
            ├── when swap leaves sell token balance
            │   └── it should transfer leftover sell tokens to caller
            ├── it should transfer wrapped collateral tokens to caller
            ├── it should leave zero sellToken balance on contract
            ├── it should leave zero buyToken balance on contract
            ├── it should leave zero collateral token balance on contract
            ├── it should leave zero underlyingToken balance on contract
            ├── it should emit Swap with underlying PT amount as buyTokenBalanceReceived
            └── it should return wrapped collateral amount received
